======================================================================
   at a fixed point p:  JF(p).(dsigma_p - I) = 0,  dsigma_p^2 = I
     eigenvalues (1, 1)    det =  1  ADMISSIBLE (det J_sigma = 1)
     eigenvalues (1, -1)   det = -1  excluded
     eigenvalues (-1, 1)   det = -1  excluded
